The gateway and reusable browser client were extracted from the local RomM
integration prototype. They retain the GNU Affero General Public License v3
license provided in LICENSE.

Core source trees and generated binaries are not included in this repository.
SameBoy, mGBA Splitscreen, Snes9x, and the EmulatorJS/RetroArch frontend retain
their respective upstream licenses. Build scripts preserve the core license
alongside generated browser packages and record the pinned source revision.

The diagnostic cartridges under test/fixtures are the original project test
fixtures. They are used solely to verify linked inputs and battery persistence.
The GBA fixture build uses linktest helpers from the pinned mGBA Splitscreen
source tree; those helpers retain the upstream project's license.
